      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Same result both ways: only orders gets through, and payments knows it is orders. In the app, every service carries TLS code;\nwith sidecars, the apps stay plaintext on localhost and the platform issues, checks and rotates identities for all of them.",
